1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:03,709
Jesus promised paradise to a criminal. Why?

2
00:00:03,857 --> 00:00:06,492
Two criminals were dying on crosses beside Him.

3
00:00:07,118 --> 00:00:10,535
If thou be Christ, save thyself and us.

4
00:00:11,023 --> 00:00:12,236
One wanted off the cross.

5
00:00:13,004 --> 00:00:14,496
The other asked for very little.

6
00:00:15,083 --> 00:00:18,581
Lord, remember me when thou comest into thy kingdom.

7
00:00:18,768 --> 00:00:21,981
He asked to be remembered. Someday.

8
00:00:22,527 --> 00:00:26,246
To day shalt thou be with me in paradise.

9
00:00:26,634 --> 00:00:28,625
Not someday. Today.

10
00:00:29,782 --> 00:00:31,912
Not just remembered. With Him.

11
00:00:33,065 --> 00:00:34,657
You can ask Him to remember you too.

